OL,3,GNEWSAImpact of Dolly Parton's UK
OL,4,Achildren's book scheme praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe impact of Dolly Parton's children's
OL,7,Fliterary scheme in the UK has been
OL,8,Fpraised by a former MP who helped bring
OL,9,Fthe charitable project to his
OL,10,Fconstituency.
OL,12,FTributes have been poured in for the
OL,13,Fcountry singer who has died aged 80.
OL,14,FHer Imagination Library has had a
OL,15,Fpresence across the south of England
OL,16,Fsince it was launched in the UK in
OL,17,F2007.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
