OL,3,GNEWSAImpact of Dolly Parton's UK
OL,4,Achildren's book scheme praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Salter, who was the MP for
OL,7,FReading West from 1997 until 2010, said
OL,8,Fhe believed his constituency was the
OL,9,Fsecond place in the country to receive
OL,10,Fthe books.
OL,12,FIn the UK, seven million books have
OL,13,Fbeen sent to children, the Imagination
OL,14,FLibrary says. It also operates in the
OL,15,FUS, Australia, Canada and Ireland, with
OL,16,F332.4 million books sent out globally.
